## Working directory (absolute)
`C:\Users\redna\.claude\.claude\worktrees\thirsty-roentgen-fc40ad`

## Context

### App structure
- `ivdr-wiki/` — React 19 + Vite 6 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4
- CSS design tokens: `var(--p1)`, `var(--p2)`, `var(--p3)`, `var(--p4)`, `var(--p1-tint)`, etc.
- `var(--max-w)`, `var(--margin)`, `var(--s-N)` spacing, `var(--t-N)` font sizes, `var(--r-N)` border-radius

### Existing components to reuse
- `PhaseBand` — accepts `{ phase: Phase, stations: Station[], activeId?: number, onOpen: (sid: number) => void, registerRef: (el: HTMLElement | null) => void }`
- `StationDetail` — accepts `{ station: Station | null, onClose: () => void }`
- `PhaseNav` — accepts `{ activePhase: PhaseId | null }`

### Existing types (in `ivdr-wiki/src/data/stations.ts`)
```ts
export type PhaseId = "p1" | "p2" | "p3" | "p4" | "p5";
export interface Phase { id: PhaseId; order: number; title: string; subtitle: string; colorVar: string; tintVar: string; }
export interface Station { id: number; phase: PhaseId; title: string; icon: string; oneLine: string; tag: { label: string; tone: TagTone }; body: string[]; todo: string; refs: string[]; note?: string; forks?: ForkPath[]; }
